  "description": "Load Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx) and PowerPoint (.pptx) files into DoclingDocument structured models with OpenXml. Preserves Word heading hierarchy and PowerPoint text/table order, with configurable metadata and Markdown serialization. File sources use normalized absolute paths for consistent RAG document identity across relative/absolute registrations and separate identities for same-named files in different folders. What's New in v1.1.1: Stable absolute-path document identity and missing worksheet/slide guards.",
