  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.1.1: Uses normalized absolute file paths as DoclingDocument.Source for stable RAG automatic IDs and separation of same-named files in different folders. Explicit IDs remain unchanged; default citations may show absolute paths. Existing relative-path records are not automatically migrated or removed; delete only identified old document IDs before reindexing, or rebuild a complete source set into a new collection. Skips missing worksheet/slide parts instead of dereferencing them. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/loaders/Mythosia.Documents.Office/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v111",
